
# @summary Path to the FreeBSD source repository the stages build from
# A git repository: `stage checkout` adds a worktree of it per stage,
# `destroy` unregisters them again. Empty by default and required by
# every source-building command, so a missing value fails at generation
# time rather than silently building the wrong tree.
#   elebake setenv ELEBAKE_FREEBSD_SRC /home/brj/git/freebsd-src
# @see ELEBAKE_FREEBSD_PREREQUISITES
